containers_without_area.description:
These containers have no area. Without one, the best-before estimate does not know where the food is stored (fridge, freezer …):

{containers}

Assign an area on the container's card in the Larder dashboard. The hint then disappears by itself.

filled_without_best_before.description:
These containers have contents but no best-before date, so they appear neither in the daily summary nor in the calendar:

{containers}

Enter a date in the Larder dashboard or use “Estimate best before”. The hint then disappears by itself.

estimate.description:
Larder estimates the best-before date of these containers:

{containers}

What the estimate does not know stays in the hint; enter it in the dashboard then.

long_expired.description:
These containers expired at least {days} days ago and should be emptied:

{containers}

Empty them in the Larder dashboard (or set a new best-before date if the food is still good). The hint then disappears by itself.

temperature_too_high.description:
**{area}** is at {temperature} °C, above {limit} °C for at least {minutes} minutes. Affected containers:

{containers}

Check whether the door is open or the appliance has failed. The hint disappears as soon as it is cold enough again.
